*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 0805HS-030
* Inductance = 3nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-15.9GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor RF Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 0805HS-030 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.038pF Ind=3.21nH
X1 port1 port2 Model2A PARAMS:
+ R1=3
+ R2=0.08
+ C= {Cpar}
+ K1=0.0000122
+ K3= {Ind}
.ends 0805HS-030

